              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Foot soldiers have a hand weapon, thrusting spear and shield. Shieldwall. May exchange thrusting spear and shield for composite bow (-2) in which case may not form Shieldwall. The number of models equipped with bows may not outnumber the number of models equipped with thrusting spears. If equipped with bows, foot soldiers are Light Infantry.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="732e-c790-ab07-11bb" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
