              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Gascon or Basque javelin men have improvised weapons and javelins. Skirmishers. Feigned Flight. They may have shields (+1) Breton Cavalry have a hand weapon, javelins, throwing spear and shield. Feigned Flight. They may have light armour (+2).</characteristic>
